WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.760
- Well get ready, because
our next guest is one

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:04.670
of America's top psychic
mediums and his readings

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.610
will definitely raise the
hairs on the back of your neck.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.440
His new...I hope I'm not too hairy.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.000
That just sounds...that's
a weird thing to say.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.360
Anyway, his new book, "When Heaven Calls,"

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.830
comes out in March and here it is

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.980
looking all good and fly.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.960
And he has a new reality show on E

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.190
called "Meet the Frasers."

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.210
Take a look.

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:25.720
- Growing up being psychic
was not easy for me.

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.670
I tried my hardest to
push this ability away,

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.290
but I went to go to see
a medium about a girl

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:35.330
that I liked, about all the
normal teenage questions,

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:37.970
and instead, I left hearing
that I was a medium.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:39.370
Hold on, I'm listening.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:42.660
I actually had to leave
my full time job as an EMT

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:45.810
because I realized I could use
this ability to help people,

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:46.986
just in a different way.

00:00:46.986 --> 00:00:48.135
(applauding)

00:00:48.135 --> 00:00:50.511
All right, y'all, please
welcome Matt Fraser!

00:00:50.511 --> 00:00:55.511
(audience applauding)
(lively music)

00:00:58.204 --> 00:01:01.704
(music drowns out speech)

00:01:08.395 --> 00:01:10.354
Have a seat.
- Thank you.

00:01:10.354 --> 00:01:11.793
- I love this!

00:01:11.793 --> 00:01:14.420
Okay so wait, here's my question,

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.940
'cause people watch
reality TV and I'm like,

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:21.940
how real is reality TV,
'cause there's cameras there,

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:23.500
so that's not real, right?

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.074
- Well listen--
- How real?

00:01:26.074 --> 00:01:27.940
- (laughing) Here's both
the good and bad parts.

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:30.300
So I'm on season one so
I didn't know any better

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.267
than to just act myself.

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:33.129
I didn't know.

00:01:33.129 --> 00:01:34.350
- Oh please keep doing that.

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:36.060
Don't be weird, like other...yeah.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.470
- I didn't know how much of
it would be on TV or whatever.

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:39.647
They said, "Okay, ignore the cameras.

00:01:39.647 --> 00:01:41.360
"Just go about your daily business."

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:43.280
So, you know, I went
about my daily business.

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:46.989
I was on the bidet, I'm
getting into my man space.

00:01:46.989 --> 00:01:48.040
(laughing)

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.770
Little did I know, wait a
minute, wait a minute now,

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:53.850
little did I know that this
was gonna end up on TV.

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:56.320
(laughing)

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:58.960
- Oh my god, I actually want to

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:00.360
be such good friends with you.

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:02.580
Like the fact that you...that is.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:05.140
I talk about my Spanx
all the time, so openly.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:06.310
It's so great!

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:07.504
- Yeah, but I'm a man.

00:02:07.504 --> 00:02:09.388
(laughing)
- Who cares?

00:02:09.388 --> 00:02:10.870
I know men that wear Spanx.

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:14.170
- Well listen, I didn't know
that the Spanx community--

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:15.250
- Yeah.
- For men--

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:16.280
- Yeah.
- Was like,

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.152
like once you say--
- That was under ground.

00:02:18.152 --> 00:02:20.600
(laughing)

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:24.703
It was easier to come out as
a medium than a Spanx man.

00:02:24.703 --> 00:02:27.374
- It was easier to come out as a medium...

00:02:27.374 --> 00:02:28.660
That's what she said.
- Oh my god.

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:29.930
- So wait, I do have a question, though.

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:31.610
So you're here, so you're here.

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:33.280
Are you feeling anything now?

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:34.220
- Yeah, it's crazy,

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.900
'cause when I look out into the audience,

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:37.700
all I see and hear is dead people.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.640
I feel like I'm connecting...

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:41.330
- Oh my god, it's like
the move "Sixth Sense."

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:42.250
You're that boy.
- It is.

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:44.480
I feel like I'm connecting
with the funeral home

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:46.880
because all these souls
that are here, you know,

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:48.140
trying to speak and trying to connect.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:50.450
And first of all, your mom departed.

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:51.650
Your mom's standing right next to you.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:53.550
Can I get up?
- What, what?

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:54.900
- Your mother's right here.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.040
The way that it works for
me is that when I'm in

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.760
a room or I'm in an area,
all of your souls will try

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:02.480
to come through and speak and
she was just standing next

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:04.750
to you and saying, "That's my
daughter, that's my daughter.:

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.410
So know it's your mom's
way of just acknowledging

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:09.060
that you're here and letting
you know that she is okay.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:10.930
This was a woman who had
suffered before her passing here

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:12.310
in the physical world.
- Yes.

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:14.290
- 'Cause what happens is,
Kelly, that they'll put me back

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:16.230
in their body to show me what had gone on.

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:17.970
And they'll stand next to
you to show you they're here

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:19.270
and she showed me she couldn't breathe

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:20.730
before she had passed.

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:22.540
- Yes, she was on a ventilator.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:25.293
- I feel like I'm drowning
when I'm connecting with her.

00:03:25.293 --> 00:03:26.126
- What?

00:03:26.126 --> 00:03:27.740
- Yeah, she had a heart attack.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:30.390
I was in the emergency room.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.210
She was 62 years old.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.060
- Your mom says to me that, first of all,

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.290
she wants to thank you for
keeping a promise to her.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:38.070
She says you promised her
that you weren't gonna leave

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.710
her side because she was afraid.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:41.190
And she says, do you know
that my daughter stayed

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:43.510
with me all night long and
you laid on the side of her

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:46.000
and you laid with her and
your mom just wants to say

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.590
thank you so much for allowing my soul

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:49.310
to go to the other side.
- Yeah.

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:50.293
- Can I give you a hug?

00:03:50.293 --> 00:03:52.426
(audience applauding)

00:03:52.426 --> 00:03:54.050
- Is that real?

00:03:54.050 --> 00:03:57.230
Mind-blown that he even
knew all those details

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:59.800
is so creepy and awesome.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.860
I am so glad I don't
see dead people, though,

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:04.160
so please dead people,
if you're in the room,

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.505
I can't handle it.

00:04:05.505 --> 00:04:06.440
(audience laughing)

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.370
Just so you know.

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:11.640
So Matt's new book, "When Heaven
Calls," comes out in March.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:12.473
Here it is.

00:04:12.473 --> 00:04:13.980
He's calling everybody on this.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:18.350
And don't miss Matt on "Meet
The Frasers," Mondays on E.

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:20.940
Coming up, we'll meet a couple
who helped foot the bill

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.550
for soldiers trying to get
home during the holiday season.

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:24.687
Please stay with us.

00:04:24.687 --> 00:04:27.396
(audience applauding)
That is crazy!

